    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth Behind the Cases No One Else Can Solve</strong><br>Step into the shoes of a private detective and investigate mysteries shrouded in the supernatural. These cases are too bizarre for the police to handle, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover the hidden truth. Play solo or team up with up to 3 other detectives to find the evidence that others missed, connect the dots, and expose secrets buried in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer or Co-op Gameplay</strong><br>Play solo or team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op to investigate and survive chilling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with teammates in real time using built-in voice chat, enhancing immersion and communication during tense moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Investigations</strong><br>Explore detailed, atmospheric environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind each mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=288 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death's Door Mechanic</strong><br>When captured by a ghost, players enter a trance state where they can escape or pull another player in to take their place, creating intense strategic and moral decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong> <br>Face terrifying phenomena that test your resolve and escalate the tension as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=298 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System</strong><br>Every playthrough features procedurally placed notes and puzzles that maintain narrative flow while keeping investigations fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=294 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in hauntingly crafted locations brought to life with cinematic visuals and immersive soundscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the unsolvable and face the unknown. The truth is out there, are you ready to uncover it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth Behind the Cases No One Else Can Solve</strong><br>Step into the shoes of a private detective and investigate mysteries shrouded in the supernatural. These cases are too bizarre for the police to handle, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover the hidden truth. Play solo or team up with up to 3 other detectives to find the evidence that others missed, connect the dots, and expose secrets buried in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer or Co-op Gameplay</strong><br>Play solo or team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op to investigate and survive chilling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/5c3992417594ac9d80d24fdd1cecf108.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with teammates in real time using built-in voice chat, enhancing immersion and communication during tense moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Investigations</strong><br>Explore detailed, atmospheric environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind each mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=288 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/93e69b07401918d84738babff0a69ee5.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death's Door Mechanic</strong><br>When captured by a ghost, players enter a trance state where they can escape or pull another player in to take their place, creating intense strategic and moral decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong> <br>Face terrifying phenomena that test your resolve and escalate the tension as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=298 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/1714a003ba65943cc292c20bebad6872.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System</strong><br>Every playthrough features procedurally placed notes and puzzles that maintain narrative flow while keeping investigations fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.poster.avif?t=1750046078\" width=294 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.webm?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/8ded0d9c46d6ee4730773c8298efbedf.mp4?t=1750046078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in hauntingly crafted locations brought to life with cinematic visuals and immersive soundscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the unsolvable and face the unknown. The truth is out there, are you ready to uncover it?</p>",
